    "longBusinessSummary": "Jiangsu Ruitai New Energy Materials Co., Ltd. researches and develops, produces, and sells lithium-ion battery materials and new chemical materials in China and internationally. The company offers main electronic chemicals, including lithium-ion battery electrolytes, lithium-ion battery electrolyte additives, supercapacitor electrolytes, and optical materials; and lithium-ion battery electrolyte products, such as power battery, energy storage battery, and consumer battery electrolytes. It also provides lithium-ion battery electrolyte additives comprising lithium difluorophosphate, lithium bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide, lithium difluorooxalate borate, and lithium trifluoromethanesulfonate; electrolyte for supercapacitors; optical materials; and silane coupling agents. The company also exports its products. The company was founded in 2017 and is headquartered in Zhangjiagang, China. Jiangsu Ruitai New Energy Materials Co., Ltd. operates as a subsidiary of Jiangsu Guotai International Group Co., Ltd.",
